<https://w3id.org/crgo/vocab/legal/CCSPA> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        crgo:CRGO_0000343 ;
    rdfs:label "Critical Cyber Systems Protection Act"@en,
        "Loi sur la protection des cybersystèmes essentiels"@fr ;
    rdfs:comment "Royal Assent announced by Public Safety Canada on 2026-06-16; the Act comes into force in phases, so no in-force date is asserted. Applies to designated operators in the vital services and systems it lists (telecommunications, interprovincial or international pipelines and power lines, nuclear energy, federally regulated transportation, banking, clearing and settlement)."@en ;
